<h2>Reset Your Password</h2>

<p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

<p>We received a request to reset your password for your Duetech account. Use the One-Time Password (OTP) below to complete the password reset process.</p>

<div class="otp-container">
    <p style="margin: 0; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">Your OTP Code</p>
    <div class="otp-code">{{otp}}</div>
    <p style="margin: 0; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">Valid for {{expiryMinutes}} minutes</p>
</div>

<div class="info-box">
